# DEMO G4 - Rueda (texto libre A-Z con el potenciometro)
wait 400
pot 80
wait 300
tap morse
wait 300
expect text Selecciona
pot 850
wait 350
expect text Rueda
shot g4_rueda_01_modo
tap morse
wait 300
expect text Escribe
shot g4_rueda_02_inicio
# letra H (indice 8): pote 335
pot 335
wait 350
shot g4_rueda_03_letraH
tap morse
wait 250
# letra I (indice 9): pote 375
pot 375
wait 350
tap morse
wait 250
expect text HI
shot g4_rueda_04_HI
# borrar la I (FINISH corto)
tap finish
wait 300
shot g4_rueda_05_borrado
# reescribir I y enviar (mantener FINISH) + salir
pot 375
wait 350
tap morse
wait 250
expect text HI
in 0 finish down
in 1700 finish up
in 2700 finish down
in 2850 finish up
run 3300
expect serial Enviando: HI
print G4 Rueda: compone HI, borra, reescribe y envia
